[{"title":"宿虎跑寺","author":"吴鼎芳","text":"湿烟郁结乱山横，敲断钟声火自明。\n野寺冰霜经晚岁，石林风雨坐残更。\n十年一梦浮云冷，四海孤身落叶轻。\n愿得皈依清净海，莲花香里证无生。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":2145,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"人日雨中上方寺看梅","author":"吴鼎芳","text":"人日初开社，香风拂寺门。\n梅花殊耐雨，一白自成村。\n湿气蒸初艳，春声散冷魂。\n钟残僧出定，留语坐黄昏。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":2146,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"无题","author":"吴鼎芳","text":"绮疏微透晓光寒，欲贴鸦黄展镜鸾。\n错怪桃花似侬面，一番风雨便春残。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":2147,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"壬子元日","author":"吴鼎芳","text":"流光去无著，倏焉岁云除。\n东风动畎亩，朝日生蓬庐。\n琴书委空壁，菽麦食无余。\n即事已如此，前路复何如。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":2148,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄情","author":"吴鼎芳","text":"残山如黛月痕斜，子夜青鞋踏浅沙。\n十里红桥东畔路，梅花多处是君家。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":2149,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"梅下送客","author":"吴鼎芳","text":"花间啼鸟唤游频，花下离歌动早春。\n断送香魂征袖雪，飘残素艳马蹄尘。\n疏枝带月牵幽梦，长蕊含烟怅别神。\n明日重过今日地，为怜歧路独醒人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":2150,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"灯下","author":"吴鼎芳","text":"野寺十年心，无言坐灯下。\n夜半风雨来，萧萧打破瓦。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":2151,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"蕉雪斋庭下送邹舜五","author":"吴鼎芳","text":"几点萧疏雨，新阴闭户生。\n美人来冉冉，相斗绿盈盈。\n似雪山斋冷，无风水簟清。\n离魂凄入夜，叶叶起秋声。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":2152,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夜宿三山寺望苕上怀吴允兆","author":"吴鼎芳","text":"只此堪乘兴，秋风一放船。\n天清皆在水，树冷不生烟。\n静后转忘寐，望穷殊可怜。\n书来同所愿，池内有青莲。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":2153,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"月夜","author":"吴鼎芳","text":"昨夜因看月，清光动旅思。\n今宵宜早睡，莫待月明时。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":2154,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄怀王元直","author":"吴鼎芳","text":"月照莼花冷，秦淮荡酒船。\n还家同一日，为别易三年。\n海树含青雨，江鸿带白烟。\n西风又飘泊，衰草自生怜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":2155,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"纪兴","author":"吴鼎芳","text":"道人赢得半生闲，枕上清泉座上山。\n犹有半生闲不得，娑椤影里扣禅关。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":2156,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"柴门","author":"吴鼎芳","text":"柴门凉气入，风动白纶巾。\n秋色孤云外，斜光映水滨。\n贫惟甘薄命，病亦任闲身。\n累月尊中禁，还来载酒人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":2157,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"虎丘僧房寻郭圣仆乘月登山","author":"吴鼎芳","text":"长堤沿短棹，转入翠微湾。\n酒伴秋相集，僧房夕不关。\n布袍先受月，竹杖早过山。\n何处歌声起，悠悠林木间。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":2158,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"空斋","author":"吴鼎芳","text":"空斋原寂寂，落叶更萧萧。\n片月闲相照，床头挂一瓢。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":2159,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"子夜歌","author":"沈野","text":"门有车马客，姊妹易衣裳。\n侬有好颜色，那在红粉妆。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":2160,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄书曲","author":"沈野","text":"行人促家信，把笔倚前轩。\n书扎经姑手，闲情不敢言。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":2161,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"采莲曲","author":"沈野","text":"解道芙蓉胜妾容，故来江上采芙蓉。\n檀郎何事偏无赖，不看芙蓉却看侬。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":2162,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"怀王澄伯卧病","author":"沈野","text":"落红寒食渐纷纷，强自携尊对夕曛。\n春到马卿偏卧病，径开羊仲正离群。\n林风几处邀歌扇，花雨千家扑舞裙。\n何事与君俱伏枕，莺声唤友不堪闻。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":2163,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春日小斋","author":"沈野","text":"社日方过花正肥，闲庭亦自长苔衣。\n柴扉暂启元无事，恐有梁间燕子归。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":2164,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"汪长文张成叔北上便道见访","author":"沈野","text":"乌皮几净映莓苔，卧病柴扉昼不开。\n庭树叶齐花尽落，屋梁尘动燕初回。\n黄金散后青山在，三径荒时二仲来。\n借问一尊留茂苑，何如并马向燕台？","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":2165,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"边词","author":"沈野","text":"塞上风高猎马稀，天山六月雪花飞。\n闺人不解征人苦，直到隆冬始寄衣。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":2166,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋日田家","author":"沈野","text":"为爱田家乐，看禾到野频。\n不关人共弃，自觉此堪亲。\n暮雨溪鱼长，秋风树果新。\n主人村酿好，长啸倒纶巾。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":2167,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄陈履吉","author":"沈野","text":"故人闽海结茅堂，海上相思更渺茫。\n地气未春先见草，山风迎腊不飞霜。\n林深采药窥猿啸，田熟开书觉稻香。\n我欲移家同避世，可能白发老沧浪。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":2168,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"斜塘招星甫","author":"沈野","text":"新芋肥鸡菊正黄，君来定拟醉千觞。\n田家村巷都相似，须识门前两绿杨。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":2169,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"冬日田家","author":"沈野","text":"腊月江村霜雪凝，蓬蒿零落绕垂藤。\n床头浊酒迎寒尽，屋后高丘候日登。\n古岸人喧看野烧，小桥船发打河冰。\n少年结束将何事，共向东皋赌放鹰。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":2170,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寒食","author":"沈野","text":"惊心芳草上河桥，雨后推窗见柳条。\n厨下从来烟火少，不知寒食是今朝。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":2171,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"短歌行","author":"沈野","text":"推弦拂柱，歌我浩曲。\n浩曲未歌，肠中踯躅。\n青青前溪，可鉴光仪。\n他心自喜，我心自悲。\n河中有船，不载客还。\n尊中有酒，不令客欢。\n栖栖何者，归以为期。\n絺衣生虱，鞋袜多泥。\n世人结交，安得常好。\n他乡寄食，安得常饱。\n主人良贤，客兴愁叹。\n报恩虽易，受恩实难。\n野鸡喔喔，夜长不晓。\n披衣庭除，月没树杪。\n士贫者贱，客久者贫。\n不如归去，可以葆真。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":2172,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋日寄豫诚","author":"沈野","text":"芙蓉渐摇落，之子旷佳期。\n日暮孤鸿度，天寒促织悲。\n黄粮舂北舍，红叶绕东篱。\n正是登高候，无由共酒卮。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":2173,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"团扇郎","author":"沈野","text":"皎皎合欢扇，郎持赠所欢。\n本欲图亲近，翻掩桃花颜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":2174,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"古诗","author":"沈野","text":"东家善枕席，西家供织作。\n东家喜月上，西家忧日落。\n日月同在天，忧喜一何殊。\n借问东家女，妾有何不如。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":2175,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"柬李茂才","author":"沈野","text":"风雨朝来罢灌园，东篱散发望郊原。\n林深如在青山里，忘却君家住对门。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":2176,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄顾世叔","author":"沈野","text":"弹铗无鱼归未期，他乡风雨倍凄其。\n那堪枕上鸡声起，绝似楼头话别时。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":2177,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠殷山人","author":"沈野","text":"鹿门高卧寂无哗，户外青山郭外斜。\n妇解绣花君解画，玉窗闲坐斗新茶。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":2178,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠吴少君","author":"沈野","text":"一瓢将一杖，随地掩柴扉。\n课仆磨长剑，教儿制短衣。\n诗留闲寺遍，梦入故乡稀。\n邂逅还成别，天寒何处归。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":2179,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"西湖","author":"葛一龙","text":"黛写残山带郭遥，镜浮新水不通潮。\n堤边绁马客投寺，花里唱歌船过桥。\n红粉年年化香土，春风处处长兰苕。\n湖心亭子湖心月，醉与何人度此宵。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":2180,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"九日送客之湘潭","author":"葛一龙","text":"吹帽风初起，那堪吹别离。\n才临放騑处，已是听猿时。\n楚服裁应短，湘山望转疑。\n归期指篱落，莫比菊花迟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":2181,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"桃花源","author":"葛一龙","text":"一涧入苍烟，千花绕涧边。\n花开与花落，流水送流年。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":2182,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"浔溪对雨","author":"葛一龙","text":"市断溪声远，桥回野色荒。\n吹来数点雨，相送一孤航。\n涨绿平官渡，烟黄拂女桑。\n隔花僧共语，东去是钱塘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":2183,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"然诺行","author":"葛一龙","text":"古人之交交以心，一语不出然诺深。\n今人之交交以面，然诺虽深中易变。\n古人不可作，今人难重陈。\n与君相见但饮酒，酒尽俱为行路人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":2184,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送实父弟归便往嘉定因寄徐女廉龚仲和","author":"葛一龙","text":"风冷夜窗鸣，离愁相对生。\n海潮黄歇浦，江岸石头城。\n穷遇悲孤调，残秋送独行。\n旧欢倾倒日，不减弟兄情。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":2185,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"初晴过孔先生园居得泥字","author":"葛一龙","text":"一雨百忧集，好山空杖藜。\n偶从樵采去，言访石林栖。\n屋角蜘蛛网，檐牙燕子泥。\n留欢对新旭，不道夕阳西。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":2186,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"灵岩山下寻黄二丈不遇","author":"葛一龙","text":"开门见山如见君，渡湖相问不相闻。\n篱边野水淡秋色，屋上老乌啼夕曛。\n邻人为说携家去，更入青山最深处。\n溪寒路狭难独行，短棹空维乌桕树。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":2187,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"别曲","author":"葛一龙","text":"具区桥下水悠悠，具区桥边郎发舟。\n郎舟好载青山去，免使蛾眉相对愁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":2188,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"晓行","author":"葛一龙","text":"日出已杲杲，西月还相照。\n农妇饷晨耕，牛衣覆霜草。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":2189,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"舟中九日","author":"葛一龙","text":"九日渡头人，迎风倚孤棹。\n江空落日远，入夜生余照。\n无菊亦无侣，开尊自相劳。\n红叶点鸥波，青烟出渔灶。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":2190,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"野桥怀郭圣仆","author":"葛一龙","text":"白板斜飞曲岸通，朱栏照见绿波中。\n故人别处犹堪忆，杨柳西边莲叶东。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":2191,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送范东生之滇南","author":"葛一龙","text":"相念亦已苦，却于离处逢。\n江声撼独往，客路趣残冬。\n天尽山忽起，瘴开云复重。\n馆人蛮语接，计口给新舂。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":2192,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"湖上","author":"葛一龙","text":"幽侣过湖上，持醪饷沙渚。\n对面坐相悦，绸缪以为语。\n垂杨团若盖，浓阴沃如雨。\n隔浦掉头人，扁舟亦来舣。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":2193,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寒园","author":"葛一龙","text":"玄冬浃阴冱，霜风摧灌莽。\n寓目鲜幽翳，一亩亦云广。\n日出茅檐间，云生泥壁上。\n偃仰足昕夕，亲朋息来往。\n空林如有人，互答斧冰响。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":2194,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"喜圣仆至","author":"葛一龙","text":"为约每无凭，今宵喜得朋。\n片云波上宅，残雨梦中镫。\n春冷花如病，斋清客当僧。\n看山不待霁，把臂入烟层。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":2195,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"圣仆宿永福寺同赋空字","author":"葛一龙","text":"萧然何所有，瓢笠与青童。\n住可为山长，来先问石公。\n梅迟若待客，松嫩已知风。\n一宿东林社，花龛对雨空。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":2196,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠王德操","author":"葛一龙","text":"无日不欢然，客来犹自眠。\n会当修禊后，诗在永和前。\n花气熏为酒，山光冷压船。\n到门幽草遍，一径踏春烟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":2197,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过金德父墓","author":"葛一龙","text":"相送心曾到，言寻路不迷。\n草齐封鬣起，山跌浪痕低。\n片石看人拜，孤花奈鸟啼。\n夜长谁慰藉，应有鹿门妻。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":2198,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"湖中别圣仆","author":"葛一龙","text":"春湖一胡满，春蒲一胡短。\n时鸟鸣嘤嘤，新杨绿菀菀。\n日半帆阴直，风柔浪花暖。\n相对自生情，将离复谁绾。\n双舻忽向背，行行暮烟远。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":2199,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过姚佩卿隐居","author":"葛一龙","text":"濑浅维舟远，山纡引路徐。\n相寻恐不见，相见喜何如。\n积雪村村断，斜阳树树疏。\n门人供宿酒，中馈炙枯鱼。\n岁事将归客，衰迟渐及予。\n松声动高阁，风叶乱残书。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":2200,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夜泊长桥同斗一君熙作","author":"葛一龙","text":"虹梁亘一里，半入溪花丛。\n县郭浮居绕，江门照影空。\n月寒春尽雪，渔集夜无风。\n语谓同舟客，前年过此中。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":2201,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"徐日方水亭雨酌","author":"葛一龙","text":"结宇芜烟际，披纱柳浪间。\n新莺同客到，微雨絜春还。\n呼取隔篱酒，看他何处山。\n重来须荡桨，荷叶已斑斑。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":2202,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送陈徵君归四明","author":"葛一龙","text":"秋风恋徂暑，吹动水烟热。\n与子结新欢，孤怀耿将别。\n言从若耶去，路指镜湖月。\n散发荡扁舟，荷花橹前折。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":2203,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"澹如过别湖上","author":"葛一龙","text":"早来湖上棹，莫是散秋暑。\n呼酒斫霜鲙，乐此菰蒲渚。\n忽言将远离，风吹白鸥起。\n今日与明朝，相去五百里。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":2204,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋阴","author":"葛一龙","text":"西爽忽自晦，不知朝与昏。\n井上半残叶，湖中无远村。\n桔槔几日罢，农牧相过存。\n云淡一如水，野风吹到门。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":2205,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄怀李丸","author":"葛一龙","text":"思君夏之日，日在东园东。\n泉漱松根下，石摇潭影中。\n睹棋来木客，司果有徂公。\n昨夜秋声起，帷褰栗叶风。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":2206,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄雨公","author":"葛一龙","text":"以尔愿初毕，一瓢行脚宽。\n那知出世法，不及避人难。\n云月千峰寺，香花五戒坛。\n微吟虽自好，或得寄余看。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":2207,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"松墩","author":"葛一龙","text":"甃石乱无次，高高积寒翠。\n一鹤懒应门，每来松下睡。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":2208,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送恬公东渡","author":"葛一龙","text":"出山何草草，曾对几黄昏。\n落日照行脚，白云空寺门。\n拄瓢半死树，乞食三家村。\n只在太湖上，水田吹浪痕。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":2209,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送衲公之彭门兼寄实甫","author":"葛一龙","text":"落叶满风寺，乱禽号雪园。\n独持空钵去，何处乞朝昏。\n野甸荒残烧，河堤积冻痕。\n倘然逢阿弟，已是到彭门。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":2210,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"鸠峰送万二之泖上兼寄朗倩明生舜五","author":"葛一龙","text":"特地一抔起，宛然湖中央。\n与君别于此，对酒情如伤。\n寒水照荒路，夕风来寺香。\n平生二三友，相忆在鲈乡。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":2211,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"可惜","author":"葛一龙","text":"出门即是客，况已渡湖遥。\n可惜藤萝月，看人卧寂寥。\n水西龙渚石，崦上虎山桥。\n梦去浑无著，秋声集夜条。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":2212,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"小除夕七里冈店宿","author":"葛一龙","text":"岁杪还行役，投栖野店空。\n牛衣夫妇对，旅况主人同。\n爨压危檐雪，灯吹破壁风。\n一冬更漏接，都在此宵中。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":2213,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"丹阳作","author":"葛一龙","text":"江流河流决如矢，曲防新筑岩岩起。\n云连粉蝶两重城，风袅绿杨三十里。\n小时行远不知劳，每向长安过此桥。\n衰鬓还骑款段马，春泥滑滑雨飘飘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":2214,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"炼药洲与郑君熙醉题石上","author":"葛一龙","text":"仙翁炼药处，荒草没为洲。\n一点水心绿，客眠如白鸥。\n今年太湖浅，添却几弓阔。\n只恐麻姑来，愁与人烟接。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":2215,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"观莳","author":"葛一龙","text":"计户各成区，开塍直到湖。\n桔槔旋老㹀，箪食走童乌。\n绿自歌边起，雨为劳者苏。\n穰穰从此日，饥可一年无。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":2216,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}}]